sis":"Irregular resource/terrain display reconstruction across Transoxiana and Khwarazm separate oasis components. Named bent river/terrace, water/pasture, foothill, basin or oasis components use variable polygon widths and interleaved allocation weights; open water, declared wetland/channel cores and named rugged/dry interiors are excluded. Widths, component shares and terrain masks are explicit geographic presentation assumptions, not a DEM, climate reconstruction, medieval carrying-capacity grid, observed settlements or independently verified historical resources. The enclosing polygon is only an indexing extent; populated ground follows the component polygons.  No source text, people, demographic prior, parent debit or chronology is changed.","sources":[{"title":"Natural Earth 1:10m land polygons, retained local geometry","url":"https://www.naturalearthdata.com/downloads/10m-physical-vectors/10m-land/","note":"Present land/water clipping only; historical shores and resource abundance are not inferred."},{"title":"Natural Earth 1:10m rivers and lake centerlines, retained local geometry","url":"https://www.naturalearthdata.com/downloads/10m-physical-vectors/10m-rivers-lake-centerlines/","note":"River directions and valley anchors; centerlines are not surveyed medieval channels or settlement locations."}],"kind":"piecewise-resource-terrain-mosaic","profileId":"uzbek-oases","componentNames":["Zarafshan oasis corridor","Khiva/lower Amu oasis margins"],"resourceKinds":["oasis-river-fan","oasis-river-terrace"],"constraints":{"landClip":"Retained Natural Earth land polygons, no offshore tolerance","channelClearanceKm":0.45,"terrainMethod":"Named coarse exclusion polygons and positive river/foothill/oasis envelopes; no elevation raster","exclusionReasons":[{"name":"Kyzylkum intervening dune core","reason":"Coarse dry dune/salt/desert-core avoidance; connected water and grazing margins remain eligible.","ring":[[61.5,40],[63,40.2],[64.1,42],[62,42.8],[61.5,40]]}]},"profil